$011044879 "Activates the color limits"
$011044880 "Dark Limit\nDefines the dark limit before which pixels are considered as black pixels."
$011044881 "Light Limit\nDefines the light limit after which pixels are considered as white pixels."
$011044882 "Saturation Limit\nDefines the saturation limit before which pixels are considered as black pixels and after which pixels are considered as color pixels."
$011044883 "Mode\nDefines the color mode, between RGB (Red, Green, Blue ) and RYGCBM ( Red, Yellow, Green, Cyan, Blue, Magenta )"
$011044884 "Red To Green\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Red Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Green pixels."
$011044885 "Green To Blue\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Green Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Blue pixels."
$011044886 "Blue To Red\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Green Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Blue pixels."
$011044887 "Red To Yellow\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Red Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Yellow pixels."
$011044888 "Yellow To Green\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Yellow Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Green pixels."
$011044889 "Green To Cyan\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Green Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Cyan pixels."
$011044890 "Cyan To Blue\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Cyan Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Blue pixels."
$011044891 "Blue To Magenta\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Blue Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Magenta pixels."
$011044892 "Magenta To Red\nDefines the Hue limit before which pixels are considered as Magenta Pixels and after which pixels are considered as Red pixels."
$011044893 "Limits"
$011044894 "Intensity"
$011044895 "Intensifies the red before applying color limits."
$011044896 "Intensifies the green before applying color limits."
$011044897 "Intensifies the blue before applying color limits."

