$000021861 "File gradient popup§\n\nLeft click to load,\nsave and reset gradients\nto their defaults."
$000021862 "Create a new gradient"
$000021863 "Copy a gradient§\n\nClicking here creates a copy\nof the current gradient\nfor modification without\ndestroying the original."
$000021864 "Delete the current gradient§\n\nDeletes the current gradient from the list."
$000021865 "Rename the current gradient§\n\nAllows the user to rename\nthe currently selected gradient."
$000021866 "Set the spread value§\n\nSpread is best described as the smoothness\nof the gradient. The more noise, the\nrougher the transition from one color to another."
$000021867 "Invert the current gradient§\n\nReverses the color spread of the gradient."
$000021868 "Gradient render result (Color + Alpha)§\n\nThis shows the user the final output render of\nthe gradient. This is the combination\nof the color gradient and the alpha gradient."
$000021869 "Gradient render color§\n\nThis shows the user the color gradient only.\nLeft clicking under the gradient color\ncreates a new key. Right click on the new key\nto pick a new color for it as well as other\noptions like deleting the key."
$000021870 "Gradient render alpha§\n\nThis shows the user the alpha gradient only.\nThis gradient controls the transparencey\nof the gradient.\nClick on a key to select it.\nChange the alpha value by using the slider.\nNotice the real-time feedback in the final output.\nLeft clicking under the alpha gradient\ncreates a new key. Right click on the new key\nto change its value as\nwell as other\noptions like deleting the key."
$000021871 "Delete Current Color Point§\n\nDeletes the currently selected color key."
