$011030031 "The layer name.§\n\nA pattern can be used :\n%Y will add the year (2015 for example).\n%m will add the month (from 01 to 12)\n%d will add the day (from 01 to 31)\n%H will add the hour (from 00 23)\n%M will add the minute (from 00 to 59)\n%S will add the second (from 00 to 59)\n%i will add an incremental integer (1, then 2, then 3...)\n%pt will add the preset type (anim/xsheet/...)\n%cln will add the current layer name\n\nExample : \"rough_%Y_%m_%d_%H_%S\""
