$000029000 "Main Panel"
$000029050 "FreeHand Dot and Single Dot Shape§\nThis tool sketches in real-time but may\nnot draw a solid line. Right clicking\nbrings up its options."
$000029051 "FreeHandLine and FreeHandFill§\nAlways draws a solid line. Clicking on the icon again\nstarts the filled freehand mode. When a shape is drawn,\nit is always completed and filled."
$000029052 "Line and PolyFill§\nAlways draws a straight line. Left clicking tacs down\nright clicking completes. Clicking on the icon again\nstarts the filled freehand mode. When a shape is drawn\nand completed it is filled."
$000029053 "Spline and SplineFill§\nLeft click once and left click again. Each left click\nlays down a point. Each point can be left clicked and moved.\nEach point also has bezier controls. Left click and drag just\noff the point and the controls become visible."
$000029054 "Rectangle and RectangleFill§\nDrag out a rectangle with the left mouse. Controls include\nedge smoothing, opacity, AntiAliasing, gradient, brush warping\nand opacity mapping. Right click the icon brings up its settings."
$000029055 "Ellipse and EllipseFill§\nDrag out an ellipse with the left mouse. Controls include\nedge smoothing, opacity, AntiAliasing, gradient, brush warping\nand opacity mapping. Right click the icon brings up its settings."
$000029056 "Paint bucket§\nLeft click to fill an area.\n\nDrag the cursor with the\nleft mouse button, to\ndisplay a realtime preview\nof the area to be filled."
$000029060 "Rectangle CutBrush§\nLeft clicking cuts a brush copy. Right clicking cuts the brush\nfrom the original. If there are multiple images selected,\nan anim brush is cut."
$000029061 "Free CutBrush§\nLeft clicking cuts a brush copy. Right clicking cuts the brush\nfrom the original. If there are multiple images selected,\nan anim brush is cut."
$000029062 "Magic Wand CutBrush§\nLeft clicking cuts a brush copy. Right clicking cuts the brush\nfrom the original. If there are multiple images selected,\nan anim brush is cut. Left click and see the fill area. By dragging\nthe mouse around with the left button depressed, the user can\nsee the selected are change in real time."
$000029063 "Poly CutBrush§\nLeft clicking cuts a brush copy. Right clicking cuts the brush\nfrom the original. If there are multiple images selected,\nan anim brush is cut."
$000029065 "Panning Tool§\nUsed for scaling and panning a layer.\nSelect the tool and adjust to desired \nscale and position and hit enter.\nIf applying to an animated layer\nhit undo, then select all images and hit enter."
$000029066 "Transform Tool§\nUsed for moving a layer\nSelect the tool and adjust to desired \nscale and position and hit enter.\nIf applying to an animated layer\nhit undo, then select all images and hit enter."
$000029067 "Perspective Tool§\nUsed to change a layer's perspective.\nSelect the tool and adjust to desired \nwarp and hit enter.\nIf applying to an animated layer\nhit undo, then select all images and hit enter."
$000029070 "FreeHand Select§\nAllows the user to make a freehand shape for a selection."
$000029071 "Rectangle Select§\nAllows the user to make a rectangle for a selection.\nRight clicking and dragging subtracts from the selection."
$000029072 "Circle Select§\nAllows the user to make a circular selection.\nRight clicking and dragging subtracts from the selection."
$000029073 "Spline Select§\nAllows the user to make a spline for a selection.\nRight clicking and dragging subtracts from the selection."
$000029074 "Magic Wand Select§\nAllows the user to make a magic wand selection for a selection.\nRight clicking and dragging subtracts from the selection."
$000029085 "Crop tool"
$000029086 "Zoom tool"
$000029090 "Color Select§\nAllows the user to select all the areas with the same color within the layer."

