$000023452 "Tool opacity in percentage§\n\nThis is the transparency of the brush."
$000023453 "Tool Aspect ratio in percentage§\n\nThis allows you to squeeze a brush."
$000023454 "Tool Angle in degrees§\n\nThis allows you to rotate a brush."
$000023455 "Step On/Off§\n\nToggles step mode on and off.\nThe step number determines how\nmany images are put down during\na brush stroke. With step mode off\nthings can slow down a bit."
$000023456 "Tool drying On/Off§\n\nWith drying on, \nas soon as the mouse button is let go the paint dries.\nWith Drying off,\nYou can stop painting and when you start again\nthe paint will blend together as if you never stoppped."
$000023457 "Gradient On/Off§\n\nAllows the user to paint with a gradient brush."
