$000023154 "Set the orientation in degrees§\n\nCauses the effect to be most promonent\nwhen the brush is traveling at a certain\nangle. This number sets the angle at which\nthis happens."
$000023155 "Set the direction in degrees§\n\nCauses the effect to be most promonent\nwhen the brush is traveling in a certain\ndirection. This number sets the degree at which\nthis happens."

