$000023685 "Select color mode§\n\nSelect in the list the color mode to\napply to the brush.\nColor : Image will be unmodified.\nAlpha : Colors will be replaced by\nA color with alpha value.\nLuma : Colors will be replaced by\nA Color to B Color gradient in\nfunction of Luma value.\nHue : Colors will be hued with\nA Color."
