$000025300 "Background Color§\nSelecting none here means the background id alpha\nor transparent. Selecting color puts a color in the background\nthat become part of the image. Selecting check puts a checker\nboard in the background for working with transparencies."
$000025301 "Color A§\nThis will be one of the colors in the checker board pattern."
$000025302 "Color B§\nThis will be one of the colors in the checker board pattern."
$000025303 "Display all layers or just the current layer§\nToggles between displaying all the layers with alpha\nto showing only the currently selected layer."
$000025304 "Creates a new layer"
$000025305 "Deletes the current layer"
$000025306 "Merge layers§\nAllows the user to merge all layers,\nVisible layers \nor only the selected layers. \nLayers can be multiple selected by shift clicking them."
$000025314 "Create a key§\nCreates a key on the timeline for \nthe currently selected image and the \ncurrently selected filter variables"
$000025315 "Delete a key§\nDeletes a key on the timeline for \nthe currently selected image and the \ncurrently selected filter variables"
$000025316 "Toggle Auto Create key§\nTurns auto key create on and off.\nWhen on, auto key will create a key\nfor the currently selected image anytime\na filter variable changes."
$000025317 "Display number/Time Code§\n\nClick here to switch display between\nnumber of fields or frames and Time\nCode."
$000025318 "Modifying layer's parameters§\n\nThe green/red button toggles layer's visibility.\nThe next set locks or unlocks the layer.\nThe button under the lamp toggles the light table.\nThe button under gradient rectangle toggles preserve transparency.\nThe next button toggles turns the layer's stencil on and off.\nand the 2 buttons under it make it positive or negative.\nClick on the folder button to define layer's group.\nThe white bar defines layer's density.\nClick under the white bar or on the 2 triangle on the right\nto change layer's blending mode.\nDouble-click on layer's name to change it.\nClick on the triangle on the right of layer's name or\nright click on layer's name to show layer's options menu\nClick on the triangle on the left of layer's name\nto collapse or uncollapse it."
$000025319 "Sound Popup§\nThis is where WAV files can be loaded into TVPaint Animation.\nThey playback with the preview and can be saved\nout with an AVI."
$000025320 "Timeline§\n\nLeft clicking and dragging in this area\nwill scrub the clip. A clip can only be\nscrubbed to the end of the selected layer.\nA single left click in this area jumps to that frame."
$000025322 "Time sound area§\nThis area will display the loaded sound file's waveform.\nSound files can be offset by holding\ndown Ctrl and left clicking and dragging the waveform."
$000025323 "Current Field, Frame or TC§\nShows the currently selected field number,\nframe number or timecode number."
$000025330 "Fit popup§\nAllows user to fit the clip to the timeline window.\nAlso allows for fitting to keys and selections."
$000025331 "Interactive Zoom Ratio§\nClick and drag on this icon to interactively\nchange the zoom level on the timeline."
$000025332 "Manage all Stencils§\n\nClick here to disable or invert\nall Stencils."
$000025333 "Layer is hidden\n\nClick on group color to access it"
$000025334 "Activate/Inactivate layer"
$000025335 "Lock/Unlock layer"
$000025336 "Positive stencil§\n\nClick here to make stencil positive"
$000025337 "Négative stencil§\n\nClick here to make stencil negative"
$000025338 "Preserve transparency§\n\nClick here to preserve layer's transparency."
$000025339 "Collapse/Uncollapse Layer§\n\nClick here to collapse or uncollapse the layer."
